No warranty
-----------
This is an unfinished technical preview provided as-is, without warranty of any
kind. It reaches the title screen, the New Game menu, save creation and loading,
the main menu, the start-game stage and the pause menu. On the stage the player's
3D model is drawn, but the stage world is not. A physical gamepad drives those
screens (RECOMP_USB=1).
